    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d121">

                <pb facs="0293" n="205" sameAs="frus:frus1933v04/pg205"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">710.G1A/321: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chairman of the American Delegation</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Hull</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Acting Secretary of
                            State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Montevideo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-12-23T11:00:00-03:00">December 23, 1933—11
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received December 23—10:30 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>81. Latest plans contemplate disposing of all points on entire agenda by Tuesday
                        next.<anchor n="46" xml:id="d121-f1"/> Best opinion is that peace
                    negotiations appear fairly encouraging.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
